<body>

<header class="report-header">
  <div class="kicker">Energy Economics Research &bull; 2010–2024</div>
  <h1>The Renewable Energy <em>Cost Revolution</em></h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Solar PV, onshore wind, and battery storage have undergone a structural cost collapse over 15 years — while annual fossil fuel subsidies remain persistent and volatile, reaching $700&nbsp;billion at peak.</p>
  <div class="header-stats">
