    <p class="section-desc">Annual global fossil fuel subsidies (direct consumption + production) in nominal billion USD. The 2022 energy price crisis drove subsidies to a record $700&nbsp;billion — nearly equal to two decades of renewable cost savings. The divergence between public support for incumbents and improving clean energy economics defines the policy challenge.</p>

